# Classify positive, negative and zero values without coercion.
let values be a list of minus 10, 0, 4.5, minus 0.75.
let signs be map every value in values to (sign of value).
assert (signs at 0) is equal to (minus 1).
assert (signs at 1) is equal to 0.
assert (signs at 2) is equal to 1.
assert (signs at 3) is equal to (minus 1).
print signs.
